---
import DoodleWave from '@components/DoodleWave.astro';
---

<section
    id="about"
    class="section border-t border-charcoal"
    aria-label="What is the Figure Zero Project?"
>
    <div class="shell">
        <div class="about__grid">
            <p
                class="about__label eyebrow"
                data-scroll
            >
                What is the<br />Figure Zero Project?
            </p>
            <div class="col-span-8 col-start-5">
                <p
                    class="about__statement font-display text-pretty"
                    data-scroll
                >
                    We are a student-run organization committed to making science more <span class="inline-block relative whitespace-nowrap"><em>engaging</em><DoodleWave /></span> and accessible to the public.
                </p>
                <div
                    class="about__columns"
                    data-scroll
                    data-scroll-stagger="0.15"
                >
                    <p class="about__paragraph text-pretty text-umber">
                        Many journals do not have graphic designers for their covers and illustrations, yet visuals are what aid understanding and grab people's attention &mdash; for both scientists and non-scientists. We achieve our goal of elevating science by recruiting passionate artists and celebrating self-expression from human creativity in the rising age of AI.
                    </p>
                    <p class="about__paragraph text-pretty text-umber">
                        While students benefit by building robust and meaningful portfolios, journals gain original artwork that highlights their research. Together, we build a diverse community connected by scientific journals' cover page &mdash; Figure Zero.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about__columns {
        display: grid;
        gap: 32px;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .about__grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 24px;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
    }

    .about__label {
        grid-column: 1 / span 3;
    }

    .about__paragraph {
        font-size: 17px;
        line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .about__statement {
        font-size: clamp(28px, calc(20px + 2.5vw), 52px);
        font-weight: 440;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        line-height: 1.12;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .about__columns {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .about__grid {
            display: block;
        }

        .about__label {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
    }
</style>
